  "What is Backloggd?": "What is Backloggd?",
  "Backloggd is a place to virtually track your game collection. Keep your backlog updated, rate the games you've played and add those upcoming to your wishlist. Share your gaming journey with your friends by following each other to keep up-to-date on your latest play sessions.": "Backloggd is a place to virtually track your game collection. Keep your backlog updated, rate the games you've played and add those upcoming to your wishlist. Share your gaming journey with your friends by following each other to keep up-to-date on your latest play sessions.",
